# Feature IDs: credit-profile, obligations, challenges, progress, social.
CONTRIBUTION_1_FEATURE_ID=challenges
CONTRIBUTION_1_TITLE=CI/CD pipeline and releases
CONTRIBUTION_1_ROLE=DevOps and release engineering
CONTRIBUTION_1_DETAIL=Built the deployment pipeline: immutable releases promoted by commit SHA with automatic application rollback, frontend artifact promotion and rollback, Docker Compose health gates, and CI checks that produce security, portability, maintainability, availability and usability evidence.

CONTRIBUTION_2_FEATURE_ID=challenges
CONTRIBUTION_2_TITLE=Production incident recovery and maintenance
CONTRIBUTION_2_ROLE=DevOps and operations
CONTRIBUTION_2_DETAIL=Recovered the live EC2 production server after an incident and preserved the evidence, then added bounded logs and disk checks before and after each deploy, and documented a reproducible production rebuild with a secret inventory.

CONTRIBUTION_3_FEATURE_ID=challenges
CONTRIBUTION_3_TITLE=Health checks and monitoring
CONTRIBUTION_3_ROLE=DevOps and backend development
CONTRIBUTION_3_DETAIL=Implemented liveness, readiness and detailed health endpoints, then set up external uptime checks, CloudWatch telemetry, alarms and a monitoring dashboard.

CONTRIBUTION_4_FEATURE_ID=challenges
CONTRIBUTION_4_TITLE=AWS architecture and RDS migration
CONTRIBUTION_4_ROLE=Cloud architecture
CONTRIBUTION_4_DETAIL=Designed and tested the move to a managed AWS RDS database: a private PostgreSQL proof of concept with a migration runner, security and a cost gate, a dump and restore rehearsal with performance and rollback timing and a go or no-go decision, and the conditional production cutover.

CONTRIBUTION_5_FEATURE_ID=obligations
CONTRIBUTION_5_TITLE=Simulated month
CONTRIBUTION_5_ROLE=Systems design, backend and frontend
CONTRIBUTION_5_DETAIL=Shaped the system design and backend behaviour of the simulated month, and built the shared deadline refetch and recovered-result hooks, the entry, briefing and session creation, budget allocation and month planning, and the score breakdown.

CONTRIBUTION_6_FEATURE_ID=obligations
CONTRIBUTION_6_TITLE=Obligation creation and data models
CONTRIBUTION_6_ROLE=Backend and database
CONTRIBUTION_6_DETAIL=Set up Prisma and the core data models, seeded the obligation categories and the data that makes insights meaningful, and worked on the flow for creating and structuring user obligations.

CONTRIBUTION_7_FEATURE_ID=challenges
CONTRIBUTION_7_TITLE=Gamification and rewards
CONTRIBUTION_7_ROLE=Gamification systems
CONTRIBUTION_7_DETAIL=Worked on the rewards experience of coins, XP and badges, including the credit and gamification data models, badge definitions and reliable badge-earned notifications across devices.

CONTRIBUTION_8_FEATURE_ID=progress
CONTRIBUTION_8_TITLE=Quizzes
CONTRIBUTION_8_ROLE=Backend development
CONTRIBUTION_8_DETAIL=Built the quiz API for daily quizzes, topics, sessions and answers with requeueing and automatic settlement, along with the quiz database models, seeded question content, and fixes to the Quests page buttons.

CONTRIBUTION_9_FEATURE_ID=credit-profile
CONTRIBUTION_9_TITLE=Accounts and authentication
CONTRIBUTION_9_ROLE=Backend and frontend development
CONTRIBUTION_9_DETAIL=Added the Supabase client and the authenticated user resolver, then built the profile update, account deactivation and data export endpoints, unique usernames, a profanity check on usernames, and guaranteed display names.

